{
  "chapter.475548C263636219.title": "&dGuhpixel",
  "chapter.475548C263636219.chapter_subtitle": [
    "14. The minigame server of the guhs. /lobby, Nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.47554813E081AD7B.title": "How Do You Get Here?",
  "quest.47554813E081AD7B.quest_desc": [
    "This chapter comes after &6The Super Compass&r in &dThe Guhmension&r: in the &dMinigames&r tab there, pick the &dGuh Internet Café \"The Slow Connection\"&r.",
    "",
    "In the café guhs are asleep behind old beige computers. Walk through the big screen and you're standing in the lobby of &dGuhpixel&r: the minigame server of the guhs. After that &6/lobby&r, &6/hub&r and &6/l&r work everywhere.",
    "",
    "Play the joke games, earn &6Guhpixel Coins&r (not an item: they are on your name) and buy things for your home with them: the Guhcade, the Guh Office and the Guh Cinema. The &dTravel Agency&r and the &dGuh Parkour&r are simply in the Guhmension. Nothing is locked: every quest ticks itself off as soon as you've done it, even if you did it before. The headings show what logically comes next. Tick this off and get chonking!",
  ],
  "quest.4755483F8948F2EB.title": "Guhmon Battle",
  "quest.4755483F8948F2EB.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to &dGym Leader Naps&r in the Guhpixel lobby and challenge him with one of your own guhs (or the gym's loaner guh). No HP here, only a &9SLEEP bar&r: whoever falls asleep first wins. Losing costs nothing.",
  ],
  "quest.475548298AF628B6.title": "All three gym badges",
  "quest.475548298AF628B6.quest_desc": [
    "The &6Badge Case&r has room for more than one badge. Win again and earn the &dNyeg Badge&r (make one of Snorkel's Naps fail with your Nyeg) and the &6Nibble Badge&r (fall asleep on a full tummy). The other five gyms are closed for a nap.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481EE824C15B.title": "Farmer Wants a Guh",
  "quest.4755481EE824C15B.quest_desc": [
    "&dHost Guhvon&r in the Guhpixel lobby is recording her TV show. Read the three letters for &6Farmer Guhrrit&r, tuck everybody in during the stay-over week and help him choose. It's only television, nyeg.",
  ],
}
